    {
      "id": "exam/edexcel-9ma0-01-2021-october/q2",
      "question": "<p>Given that</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathrm f(x)=x^2-4x+5\\qquad x\\in\\mathbb R\" data-display=\"true\"></div><ol class=\"parts\"><li>express <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm f(x)\"></span> in the form <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(x+a)^2+b\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\"></span> are integers to be found. <span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></li></ol><p>The curve with equation <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\mathrm f(x)\"></span></p><ul><li>meets the <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y\"></span>-axis at the point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\"></span></li><li>has a minimum turning point at the point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"Q\"></span></li></ul><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"2\"><li>Write down<ol class=\"parts\" type=\"i\"><li>the coordinates of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\"></span></li><li>the coordinates of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"Q\"></span> <span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></li></ol></li></ol>",
