    {
      "id": "exam/edexcel-9ma0-01-2021-october/q3",
      "question": "<p>The sequence <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_1, u_2, u_3, \\ldots\"></span> is defined by</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"u_{n+1}=k-\\frac{24}{u_n}\\qquad u_1=2\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p>where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\"></span> is an integer.</p><p>Given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_1+2u_2+u_3=0\"></span></p><ol class=\"parts\"><li>show that<div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"3k^2-58k+240=0\" data-display=\"true\"></div><span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></li><li>Find the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\"></span>, giving a reason for your answer. <span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></li><li>Find the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_3\"></span> <span class=\"marks\">(1)</span></li></ol>",
