      "id": "exam/edexcel-9ma0-01-2021-october/q5",
      "question": "<p><strong>In this question you should show all stages of your working.</strong></p><p><strong>Solutions relying entirely on calculator technology are not acceptable.</strong></p><p>A company made a profit of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\pounds 20\\,000\"></span> in its first year of trading, Year 1</p><p>A model for future trading predicts that the yearly profit will increase by 8% each year, so that the yearly profits will form a geometric sequence.</p><p>According to the model,</p><ol class=\"parts\"><li>show that the profit for Year 3 will be <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\pounds 23\\,328\"></span> <span class=\"marks\">(1)</span></li><li>find the first year when the yearly profit will exceed <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\pounds 65\\,000\"></span> <span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></li><li>find the total profit for the first 20 years of trading, giving your answer to the nearest <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\pounds 1000\"></span> <span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></li></ol>",
