    {
      "id": "exam/edexcel-9ma0-01-2021-october/q7",
      "question": "<p>The circle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\"></span> has equation</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"x^2+y^2-10x+4y+11=0\" data-display=\"true\"></div><ol class=\"parts\"><li>Find<ol class=\"parts\" type=\"i\"><li>the coordinates of the centre of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\"></span>,</li><li>the exact radius of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\"></span>, giving your answer as a simplified surd. <span class=\"marks\">(4)</span></li></ol></li></ol><p>The line <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"l\"></span> has equation <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=3x+k\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\"></span> is a constant.</p><p>Given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"l\"></span> is a tangent to <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\"></span>,</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"2\"><li>find the possible values of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\"></span>, giving your answers as simplified surds. <span class=\"marks\">(5)</span></li></ol>",
