    {
      "id": "exam/edexcel-9ma0-01-2021-october/q8",
      "question": "<p>A scientist is studying the growth of two different populations of bacteria.</p><p>The number of bacteria, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"N\"></span>, in the <strong>first</strong> population is modelled by the equation</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"N=A\\mathrm e^{kt}\\qquad t\\geqslant 0\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p>where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\"></span> are positive constants and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t\"></span> is the time in hours from the start of the study.</p><p>Given that</p><ul><li>there were 1000 bacteria in this population at the start of the study</li><li>it took exactly 5 hours from the start of the study for this population to double</li></ul><ol class=\"parts\"><li>find a complete equation for the model. <span class=\"marks\">(4)</span></li><li>Hence find the rate of increase in the number of bacteria in this population exactly 8 hours from the start of the study. Give your answer to 2 significant figures. <span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></li></ol><p>The number of bacteria, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"M\"></span>, in the <strong>second</strong> population is modelled by the equation</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"M=500\\mathrm e^{1.4kt}\\qquad t\\geqslant 0\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p>where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\"></span> has the value found in part (a) and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t\"></span> is the time in hours from the start of the study.</p><p>Given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"T\"></span> hours after the start of the study, the number of bacteria in the two different populations was the same,</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"3\"><li>find the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"T\"></span>. <span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></li></ol>",
      "steps": [
        "<figure class=\"exam-solution-source\" style=\"margin:2mm 0\"><img src=\"resources/exams/edexcel-9ma0-01-2021-october/q08-ms-p16-1.svg\" alt=\"Official mark scheme for original question 8; source page 16, segment 1 of 2. Includes the original working, marks, alternative methods and examiner guidance in source order.\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;max-width:100%\"></figure>",
