    {
      "id": "exam/edexcel-9ma0-01-2021-october/q9",
      "question": "<div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathrm f(x)=\\frac{50x^2+38x+9}{(5x+2)^2(1-2x)}\\qquad x\\neq-\\frac25\\quad x\\neq\\frac12\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p>Given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm f(x)\"></span> can be expressed in the form</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{A}{5x+2}+\\frac{B}{(5x+2)^2}+\\frac{C}{1-2x}\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p>where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\"></span> are constants</p><ol class=\"parts\"><li><ol class=\"parts\" type=\"i\"><li>find the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\"></span> and the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\"></span></li><li>show that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A=0\"></span> <span class=\"marks\">(4)</span></li></ol></li><li><ol class=\"parts\" type=\"i\"><li>Use binomial expansions to show that, in ascending powers of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\"></span><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathrm f(x)=p+qx+rx^2+\\ldots\" data-display=\"true\"></div>where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"p\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"q\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"r\"></span> are simplified fractions to be found.</li><li>Find the range of values of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\"></span> for which this expansion is valid. <span class=\"marks\">(7)</span></li></ol></li></ol>",
      "steps": [
