    {
      "id": "exam/edexcel-9ma0-01-2021-october/q10",
      "question": "<p><strong>In this question you should show all stages of your working.</strong></p><p><strong>Solutions relying entirely on calculator technology are not acceptable.</strong></p><ol class=\"parts\"><li>Given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"1+\\cos 2\\theta+\\sin 2\\theta\\neq 0\"></span> prove that<div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{1-\\cos 2\\theta+\\sin 2\\theta}{1+\\cos 2\\theta+\\sin 2\\theta}\\equiv\\tan\\theta\" data-display=\"true\"></div><span class=\"marks\">(4)</span></li><li>Hence solve, for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"0&lt;x&lt;180^\\circ\"></span><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{1-\\cos 4x+\\sin 4x}{1+\\cos 4x+\\sin 4x}=3\\sin 2x\" data-display=\"true\"></div>giving your answers to one decimal place where appropriate. <span class=\"marks\">(4)</span></li></ol>",
      "steps": [
